  "historyNote": "#7765, eff 9-27-02; ss by #8989, eff 9-22-07, EXPIRES: 3-20-08 (from Emp 404.08); ss by #9092, eff 2-23-08, EXPIRED: 2-23-16 New. #12960, INTERIM, eff 12-26-19, EXPIRED: 6-23-20 New. #13074, eff 7-22-20",
